  "review": {
    "finding": "The adapters improve teacher-forced spoken-token likelihood only modestly. The name episode remains7/32 exact token predictions for base,run01andrun02; run02 mean word CE4.199 vsbase4.865. Ground-truth history does not yield strong memorization even of this training episode.",
    "interpretation": "Consistent with weak adaptation/underfitting; does not establish a unique cause. Silence-weight reduction improves some spoken-token losses but is insufficient.",
    "next": "Controlled tenfold learning-rate increase with otherwise matched speech-run02 setup; no change to validation selection or acceptance."
  }
